1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,226
StoreTryOn helps shoppers preview a shirt

2
00:00:02,226 --> 00:00:04,203
or jacket, then keep a shopping

3
00:00:04,203 --> 00:00:06,179
list, all in a SPECS Lens.

4
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:10,239
This walkthrough is Lens Studio’s SPECS

5
00:00:10,239 --> 00:00:12,227
preview, using clearly labelled synthetic photos.

6
00:00:12,227 --> 00:00:14,216
I load the shopper photo once.

7
00:00:14,216 --> 00:00:16,204
The Lens reuses it for the

8
00:00:16,204 --> 00:00:17,530
rest of the visit.

9
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:24,094
I select Shirt and load the

10
00:00:24,094 --> 00:00:25,937
garment photo. The review lets me

11
00:00:25,937 --> 00:00:27,781
inspect it before sending. Only Try

12
00:00:27,781 --> 00:00:29,624
it on starts an API request.

13
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:38,549
That action sends both photos over

14
00:00:38,549 --> 00:00:40,849
HTTPS to the protected proxy, which

15
00:00:40,849 --> 00:00:43,148
keeps the YouCam key on the

16
00:00:43,148 --> 00:00:45,447
server. It uploads the images, creates

17
00:00:45,447 --> 00:00:47,747
a Clothes V4 task, polls for

18
00:00:47,747 --> 00:00:50,046
completion, and downloads the result. The

19
00:00:50,046 --> 00:00:52,345
on-screen stages reflect that work, with

20
00:00:52,345 --> 00:00:53,495
no fake percentage.

21
00:01:06,250 --> 00:01:07,956
The returned image is a real

22
00:01:07,956 --> 00:01:09,661
YouCam result. I compare it with

23
00:01:09,661 --> 00:01:11,367
the garment, then add it to

24
00:01:11,367 --> 00:01:13,072
my shopping list. A second tap

25
00:01:13,072 --> 00:01:14,778
cannot save the same result twice.

26
00:01:24,250 --> 00:01:26,494
Local storage keeps JPEG thumbnails instead

27
00:01:26,494 --> 00:01:28,737
of expiring links. I open a

28
00:01:28,737 --> 00:01:30,981
saved item to see both photos.

29
00:01:30,981 --> 00:01:32,851
Clearing the list requires confirmation.

30
00:01:38,250 --> 00:01:40,513
YouCam AI Clothes V4 uses upper_body

31
00:01:40,513 --> 00:01:42,777
for shirts and outer for jackets,

32
00:01:42,777 --> 00:01:45,040
layering jackets over the existing outfit.

33
00:01:48,250 --> 00:01:50,886
Capture, try on, save. Preview appearance.

34
00:01:50,886 --> 00:01:52,644
Check fit in store.
